+        "A canonical JSON list of n length-two paths [a,u,v], sorted by a, "
+        "using every altruist, middle recipient, and terminal recipient exactly "
+        "once.  Entries are distinct vertex IDs in 0..3n-1."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
